    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d128">

                <pb facs="0446" n="388" xml:id="pg388"/>

                <head>Mr. Courtney to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office of the District Attorney of
                                the United States, for the Southern District of New York</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 14, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt, on the 11th instant, of your favor of the 8th instant, respecting the
                    enclosures, &amp;c., of a letter to be posted to Don Antonio Lopez de Santa
                    Anna, jr.</p>
                <p>After making diligent inquiry I ascertained there is such a person as mentioned
                    in your letter, and he is represented to be the nephew of Don Antonio Lopez de
                    Santa Anna. I have, in accordance with your instructions, deposited in the post
                    office of New York the letter you enclosed, directed “Señor Don Antonio Lopez de
                    Santa Anna, jr., New York.” I enclose herewith the documents mailed to me,
                    excepting the letter above referred to.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SAMUEL G. COURTNEY, <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Attorney</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
